<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sbarro lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sbarro lowered on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown analyst Steven Rockwell said he downgraded Sbarro Inc to market perform from buy due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- said move was unrelated to company's fundamentals.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 3/4 to 28-3/4.</p>
</text>
